h to regulation rather than an ad-hoc one. High efficiency (weeks $\\rightarrow$ hours) allows for faster time-to-market without sacrificing legal safety.\n    *   *Risks:* Is \"middleware\" enough? Article 12 requires that systems *technically allow* recording. A library/SDK is a primary way to achieve this. The use of Parquet (columnar storage) is efficient for the volume of logs expected in AI systems.\n\n    *   The proposal is highly aligned with the objective. It treats compliance as a first-class engineering requirement and provides a scalable, verifiable mechanism to ensure Article 12 adherence across multiple projects.",
