chnical handovers).\n\n    *   The proposal is technically sound and uses existing paradigms (versioning/centralization).\n    *   By assigning a small team to manage it, the impact on prototyping speed is minimized while ensuring quality.\n    *   Linking docs to log streams is a high-value technical feature for traceability.",
