h.\n    *   Furthermore, robust logging is a prerequisite for rigorous scientific evaluation of AI systems (e.g., debugging unexpected behavior in high-risk settings).\n\n    *   Rationale: Integrating compliance requirements into prototype scaffolds reduces the administrative burden on researchers and ensures that data used for scientific validation is captured consistently from the start. This protects research velocity and enhances the reproducibility of experimental results.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: High (85-90). It's a pragmatic win that prevents \"compliance debt\" from hindering actual R&D.",
