t a luxury?\n    *   No. In the context of high-risk AI, you can't \"just implement\" logging if you don't know what you are logging. The definition *is* part of the implementation process for compliance. If we simply log everything (brute force), we might violate data minimization or create noise that makes monitoring impossible. A formal approach is the professional way to handle this.",
